<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90538" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρότμησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτέμνω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>waist</i> or
			<i>loins</i>, where the body is drawn in, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.424
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				6.374
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσφῦς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1017.7
			</span></i> (Sinope, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); but cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				691.18
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρότμητιν</span> is a variant in
			Sch.T Il.l.c.,cf.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτμῆτις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρότμηστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phot.
				</span></i>
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτμητόν: τὸν ὀμφαλόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
